{"page":401,"width":1735,"height":2630,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"10.6 스래싱","words":[{"text":"10.6","x":1249,"y":154,"width":72,"height":23},{"text":"스래싱","x":1336,"y":154,"width":70,"height":26}]},{"text":"461","words":[{"text":"461","x":1480,"y":150,"width":54,"height":29}]},{"text":"로세스의 모든 메모리 할당을 lgroup 내에서 해결하려고 한다. lgroup 내에서 충족이","words":[{"text":"로세스의","x":280,"y":279,"width":132,"height":37},{"text":"모든","x":430,"y":281,"width":65,"height":34},{"text":"메모리","x":510,"y":280,"width":90,"height":37},{"text":"할당을","x":618,"y":279,"width":93,"height":37},{"text":"lgroup","x":724,"y":282,"width":102,"height":41},{"text":"내에서","x":844,"y":282,"width":86,"height":37},{"text":"해결하려고","x":949,"y":282,"width":155,"height":38},{"text":"한다.","x":1117,"y":283,"width":69,"height":37},{"text":"lgroup","x":1202,"y":285,"width":108,"height":40},{"text":"내에서","x":1328,"y":282,"width":93,"height":38},{"text":"충족이","x":1440,"y":283,"width":96,"height":38}]},{"text":"불가능하면, 필요한 나머지 자원에 대해 이웃 lgroup을 선택한다. 이 방법은 전체 메모","words":[{"text":"불가능하면,","x":280,"y":339,"width":176,"height":38},{"text":"필요한","x":473,"y":341,"width":95,"height":35},{"text":"나머지","x":582,"y":340,"width":89,"height":38},{"text":"자원에","x":687,"y":339,"width":88,"height":39},{"text":"대해","x":792,"y":341,"width":57,"height":38},{"text":"이웃","x":866,"y":342,"width":60,"height":37},{"text":"lgroup을","x":939,"y":343,"width":137,"height":43},{"text":"선택한다.","x":1089,"y":344,"width":132,"height":37},{"text":"이","x":1238,"y":343,"width":27,"height":37},{"text":"방법은","x":1282,"y":343,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"전체","x":1394,"y":343,"width":61,"height":37},{"text":"메모","x":1473,"y":344,"width":65,"height":36}]},{"text":"리 지연시간을 최소화하고 CPU 개시 적중률을 최대로 한다.","words":[{"text":"리","x":283,"y":400,"width":27,"height":36},{"text":"지연시간을","x":328,"y":400,"width":165,"height":37},{"text":"최소화하고","x":506,"y":401,"width":157,"height":38},{"text":"CPU","x":673,"y":404,"width":73,"height":30},{"text":"개시","x":759,"y":402,"width":56,"height":37},{"text":"적중률을","x":832,"y":402,"width":121,"height":38},{"text":"최대로","x":965,"y":403,"width":91,"height":37},{"text":"한다.","x":1067,"y":404,"width":68,"height":37}]},{"text":"10.6 스래싱 Thrashing","words":[{"text":"10.6","x":148,"y":544,"width":118,"height":36},{"text":"스래싱","x":303,"y":544,"width":114,"height":42},{"text":"Thrashing","x":453,"y":554,"width":174,"height":34}]},{"text":"프로세스에 “충분한” 프레임이 없는 경우, 즉 작업 집합의 페이지를 지원하는 데 필요한","words":[{"text":"프로세스에","x":281,"y":639,"width":166,"height":36},{"text":"“충분한”","x":463,"y":639,"width":123,"height":36},{"text":"프레임이","x":600,"y":640,"width":120,"height":37},{"text":"없는","x":738,"y":640,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"경우,","x":811,"y":640,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"즉","x":891,"y":641,"width":31,"height":35},{"text":"작업","x":933,"y":640,"width":57,"height":37},{"text":"집합의","x":1008,"y":641,"width":87,"height":36},{"text":"페이지를","x":1112,"y":641,"width":124,"height":37},{"text":"지원하는","x":1250,"y":642,"width":128,"height":37},{"text":"데","x":1392,"y":642,"width":27,"height":37},{"text":"필요한","x":1438,"y":642,"width":100,"height":36}]},{"text":"최소 프레임도 없는 경우 어떤 일이 발생하는지 고려하자. 그 프로세스는 곧바로 페이지","words":[{"text":"최소","x":282,"y":699,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"프레임도","x":362,"y":700,"width":133,"height":36},{"text":"없는","x":510,"y":701,"width":63,"height":35},{"text":"경우","x":587,"y":701,"width":61,"height":36},{"text":"어떤","x":661,"y":701,"width":59,"height":36},{"text":"일이","x":736,"y":700,"width":54,"height":36},{"text":"발생하는지","x":807,"y":701,"width":147,"height":37},{"text":"고려하자.","x":970,"y":702,"width":128,"height":36},{"text":"그","x":1112,"y":707,"width":31,"height":24},{"text":"프로세스는","x":1155,"y":702,"width":159,"height":36},{"text":"곧바로","x":1325,"y":703,"width":98,"height":36},{"text":"페이지","x":1437,"y":703,"width":95,"height":37}]},{"text":"폴트를 일으킬 것이다. 이때 페이지 교체가 필요하지만 이미 활斟게 시용되는 페이지","words":[{"text":"폴트를","x":280,"y":761,"width":103,"height":36},{"text":"일으킬","x":400,"y":761,"width":93,"height":36},{"text":"것이다.","x":512,"y":761,"width":101,"height":36},{"text":"이때","x":631,"y":762,"width":57,"height":36},{"text":"페이지","x":706,"y":761,"width":87,"height":36},{"text":"교체가","x":810,"y":762,"width":92,"height":36},{"text":"필요하지만","x":916,"y":761,"width":150,"height":38},{"text":"이미","x":1080,"y":762,"width":56,"height":37},{"text":"활斟게","x":1152,"y":763,"width":123,"height":36},{"text":"시용되는","x":1291,"y":763,"width":131,"height":36},{"text":"페이지","x":1436,"y":763,"width":95,"height":37}]},{"text":"들만으로 이루어져 있으므로 어떤 페이지가 교체되든 바로 다시 필요해질 것이다. 결과","words":[{"text":"들만으로","x":280,"y":822,"width":136,"height":34},{"text":"이루어져","x":432,"y":822,"width":125,"height":36},{"text":"있으므로","x":577,"y":822,"width":124,"height":36},{"text":"어떤","x":716,"y":822,"width":58,"height":36},{"text":"페이지가","x":790,"y":822,"width":121,"height":37},{"text":"교체되든","x":924,"y":822,"width":121,"height":37},{"text":"바로","x":1058,"y":824,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"다시","x":1132,"y":823,"width":56,"height":36},{"text":"필요해질","x":1207,"y":824,"width":124,"height":35},{"text":"것이다.","x":1348,"y":824,"width":103,"height":36},{"text":"결과","x":1469,"y":824,"width":67,"height":37}]},{"text":"적으로 바로바로 반복해서 페이지 폴트가 발생하며 교체된 페이지는 다시 얼마 지나지","words":[{"text":"적으로","x":281,"y":882,"width":100,"height":36},{"text":"바로바로","x":398,"y":883,"width":131,"height":36},{"text":"반복해서","x":544,"y":883,"width":123,"height":37},{"text":"페이지","x":686,"y":882,"width":88,"height":37},{"text":"폴트가","x":792,"y":883,"width":93,"height":36},{"text":"발생하며","x":899,"y":883,"width":116,"height":37},{"text":"교체된","x":1033,"y":884,"width":90,"height":36},{"text":"페이지는","x":1139,"y":884,"width":124,"height":36},{"text":"다시","x":1277,"y":884,"width":59,"height":37},{"text":"얼마","x":1357,"y":885,"width":64,"height":36},{"text":"지나지","x":1435,"y":884,"width":95,"height":37}]},{"text":"않아 읽어올 필요가 생긴다.","words":[{"text":"않아","x":281,"y":943,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"읽어올","x":362,"y":944,"width":98,"height":36},{"text":"필요가","x":473,"y":944,"width":97,"height":36},{"text":"생긴다.","x":581,"y":944,"width":101,"height":36}]},{"text":"이러한 과도한 페이징 작업을 스래å(thrashlng)이라고 부른다. 어떤 프로세스가","words":[{"text":"이러한","x":345,"y":1005,"width":100,"height":36},{"text":"과도한","x":460,"y":1005,"width":100,"height":35},{"text":"페이징","x":576,"y":1005,"width":91,"height":36},{"text":"작업을","x":686,"y":1004,"width":95,"height":36},{"text":"스래å(thrashlng)이라고","x":795,"y":1005,"width":361,"height":43},{"text":"부른다.","x":1170,"y":1007,"width":101,"height":36},{"text":"어떤","x":1290,"y":1008,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"프로세스가","x":1369,"y":1007,"width":168,"height":36}]},{"text":"실제 실행보다 더 많은 시간을 페이징에 사용하고 있으면 스래싱이 발생했다고 한다. 예","words":[{"text":"실제","x":281,"y":1065,"width":63,"height":37},{"text":"실행보다","x":361,"y":1065,"width":133,"height":37},{"text":"더","x":507,"y":1066,"width":27,"height":36},{"text":"많은","x":552,"y":1066,"width":64,"height":36},{"text":"시간을","x":628,"y":1065,"width":94,"height":37},{"text":"페이징에","x":734,"y":1065,"width":121,"height":37},{"text":"사용하고","x":870,"y":1065,"width":122,"height":37},{"text":"있으면","x":1006,"y":1066,"width":88,"height":36},{"text":"스래싱이","x":1108,"y":1068,"width":118,"height":36},{"text":"발생했다고","x":1242,"y":1068,"width":159,"height":36},{"text":"한다.","x":1413,"y":1067,"width":74,"height":36},{"text":"예","x":1504,"y":1067,"width":30,"height":36}]},{"text":"상대뢰 스래싱은 심각한 성능 문제를 야기한다.","words":[{"text":"상대뢰","x":280,"y":1127,"width":110,"height":38},{"text":"스래싱은","x":403,"y":1127,"width":132,"height":36},{"text":"심각한","x":547,"y":1127,"width":96,"height":37},{"text":"성능","x":654,"y":1127,"width":63,"height":36},{"text":"문제를","x":727,"y":1127,"width":94,"height":36},{"text":"야기한다.","x":833,"y":1127,"width":128,"height":36}]},{"text":"10.6.1 스래싱의 원인 cause of Thrashing","words":[{"text":"10.6.1","x":281,"y":1242,"width":136,"height":30},{"text":"스래싱의","x":462,"y":1241,"width":121,"height":34},{"text":"원인","x":595,"y":1241,"width":58,"height":33},{"text":"cause","x":679,"y":1249,"width":92,"height":22},{"text":"of","x":781,"y":1249,"width":31,"height":22},{"text":"Thrashing","x":820,"y":1249,"width":139,"height":27}]},{"text":"초기의 페이징 시스템에서 실제로 있었던 다음 경우를 보자. 운영체제는 CPU의 이펑뤁","words":[{"text":"초기의","x":282,"y":1316,"width":97,"height":37},{"text":"페이징","x":396,"y":1316,"width":94,"height":37},{"text":"시스템에서","x":508,"y":1316,"width":156,"height":37},{"text":"실제로","x":681,"y":1315,"width":93,"height":37},{"text":"있었던","x":788,"y":1315,"width":90,"height":37},{"text":"다음","x":891,"y":1316,"width":62,"height":36},{"text":"경우를","x":965,"y":1316,"width":91,"height":36},{"text":"보자.","x":1068,"y":1317,"width":66,"height":35},{"text":"운영체제는","x":1147,"y":1316,"width":157,"height":36},{"text":"CPU의","x":1314,"y":1316,"width":107,"height":36},{"text":"이펑뤁","x":1438,"y":1315,"width":99,"height":37}]},{"text":"(utilizaåon)을 감시한다. 만약에 CPU 이펑뤁이 너무 낮아지면 새로운 프로세스를 시","words":[{"text":"(utilizaåon)을","x":284,"y":1378,"width":232,"height":39},{"text":"감시한다.","x":530,"y":1378,"width":134,"height":36},{"text":"만약에","x":681,"y":1377,"width":90,"height":36},{"text":"CPU","x":787,"y":1380,"width":74,"height":29},{"text":"이펑뤁이","x":877,"y":1377,"width":117,"height":36},{"text":"너무","x":1012,"y":1377,"width":60,"height":37},{"text":"낮아지면","x":1085,"y":1377,"width":122,"height":37},{"text":"새로운","x":1221,"y":1377,"width":94,"height":37},{"text":"프로세스를","x":1328,"y":1377,"width":162,"height":36},{"text":"시","x":1504,"y":1377,"width":29,"height":36}]},{"text":"스템에 더 추가해서 다중 프로그래밍의 정도(degree of multiprogramming)를 높인","words":[{"text":"스템에","x":284,"y":1439,"width":96,"height":36},{"text":"더","x":399,"y":1439,"width":27,"height":36},{"text":"추가해서","x":444,"y":1439,"width":127,"height":36},{"text":"다중","x":590,"y":1439,"width":64,"height":36},{"text":"프로그래밍의","x":667,"y":1438,"width":184,"height":37},{"text":"정도(degree","x":869,"y":1438,"width":177,"height":42},{"text":"of","x":1060,"y":1441,"width":32,"height":30},{"text":"multiprogramming)를","x":1104,"y":1439,"width":354,"height":42},{"text":"높인","x":1470,"y":1438,"width":66,"height":35}]},{"text":"다. 이때 전역 페이지 교체 알고리즘을 사용하여 어떤 프로세스의 페이지인지에 대한 고","words":[{"text":"다.","x":285,"y":1499,"width":39,"height":36},{"text":"이때","x":341,"y":1500,"width":61,"height":36},{"text":"전역","x":420,"y":1499,"width":60,"height":36},{"text":"페이지","x":498,"y":1500,"width":93,"height":36},{"text":"교체","x":608,"y":1499,"width":59,"height":36},{"text":"알고리즘을","x":684,"y":1499,"width":156,"height":36},{"text":"사용하여","x":851,"y":1499,"width":119,"height":36},{"text":"어떤","x":988,"y":1499,"width":58,"height":36},{"text":"프로세스의","x":1059,"y":1500,"width":151,"height":36},{"text":"페이지인지에","x":1225,"y":1499,"width":186,"height":37},{"text":"대한","x":1428,"y":1499,"width":65,"height":36},{"text":"고","x":1504,"y":1504,"width":35,"height":25}]},{"text":"려 없이 교체를 수행한다. 이제 어떤 프로세스가 새로운 실행 단계로 진입하여 더 많은","words":[{"text":"려","x":287,"y":1560,"width":26,"height":35},{"text":"없이","x":334,"y":1560,"width":60,"height":36},{"text":"교체를","x":413,"y":1560,"width":99,"height":36},{"text":"수행한다.","x":525,"y":1560,"width":136,"height":36},{"text":"이제","x":679,"y":1560,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"어떤","x":755,"y":1560,"width":60,"height":36},{"text":"프로세스가","x":830,"y":1560,"width":155,"height":36},{"text":"새로운","x":997,"y":1561,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"실행","x":1104,"y":1561,"width":57,"height":36},{"text":"단계로","x":1177,"y":1561,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"진입하여","x":1285,"y":1561,"width":122,"height":36},{"text":"더","x":1427,"y":1560,"width":26,"height":35},{"text":"많은","x":1472,"y":1560,"width":67,"height":36}]},{"text":"프레임이 필요하다고 가정하자. 페이지 폴트가 발생하면서 다른 프로세스로부터 프레임","words":[{"text":"프레임이","x":284,"y":1620,"width":129,"height":35},{"text":"필요하다고","x":432,"y":1620,"width":162,"height":36},{"text":"가정하자.","x":608,"y":1620,"width":132,"height":36},{"text":"페이지","x":756,"y":1620,"width":88,"height":36},{"text":"폴트가","x":860,"y":1621,"width":95,"height":35},{"text":"발